$10 granted, on the condition that ExI members have to send in at
least $10 more above and beyond the normal ExI membership to have 
the $10 prorated.  I'm an ExI member, and I would probably sign up for 
the new software if I can do it by e-mail and not pay extra, but that 
shouldn't be extrapolated to the assumption that I would pay $X for the 
service.

