ExI currently has *no* on-line presence suitable
for spreading the meme, instead relying soley on our print
publications.   Usenet reaches millions of people; the typical
newsgroup readership is in the 10,000's.  This dwarfs the
print publication readership (5,000 at last count).  At the
very least, an on-line presence would strongly complement the
print publication.  I suggest that we develop an on-line Usenet 
"Extropians light" presence, perhaps by "taking over" alt.extropy.  
